            <ArticleTitle>Understanding the comprehensive pediatric headache examination.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>442-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Understanding and learning how to perform a comprehensive headache examination is an important part of any pediatric practice. Developing these skills allows clinicians to better take care of their patients and, when necessary, obtain a more extensive consultation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
